{"id":66677,"date":"2025-08-29T08:24:37","date_gmt":"2025-08-29T07:24:37","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/?post_type=ajde_events&#038;p=66677"},"modified":"2026-09-27T22:52:18","modified_gmt":"2026-09-27T21:52:18","slug":"sines-triathlon","status":"publish","type":"ajde_events","link":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/eventos\/sines-triathlon\/","title":{"rendered":"Sines Triathlon 2026"},"content":{"rendered":"<style>.event_description, .eventcard, .evo_eventcard, .pr-page-wrapper { height: auto !important; max-height: none !important; overflow: visible !important; }<\/style>\n<p><!-- CARD 1: DESCRI\u00c7\u00c3O GERAL --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 16px;\">Sobre <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">Sines Triathlon 2026<\/span><\/h2>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">O <strong>Sines Triathlon 2026<\/strong> (3\u00aa edi\u00e7\u00e3o) realiza-se no domingo, <strong>27 de Setembro de 2026<\/strong>, na emblem\u00e1tica cidade costeira de <strong>Sines<\/strong>, distrito de <strong>Set\u00fabal<\/strong>. Organizado pela prestigiada <strong>HMS Sports<\/strong> com o apoio do Munic\u00edpio de Sines e a homologa\u00e7\u00e3o t\u00e9cnica da Federa\u00e7\u00e3o de Triatlo de Portugal, o evento desafia os atletas num percurso total de <strong>100 km<\/strong> de pura supera\u00e7\u00e3o no litoral alentejano.<\/p>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">A competi\u00e7\u00e3o inicia-se com <strong>2 km de nata\u00e7\u00e3o<\/strong> na praia da Ba\u00eda de Sines (Praia Vasco da Gama) em formato <em>rolling start<\/em> a partir das <strong>08:00<\/strong>. Seguem-se <strong>80 km de ciclismo<\/strong> sem v\u00e1cuo (3 voltas de aproximadamente 27 km com transi\u00e7\u00e3o no Passeio Vasco da Gama) e culmina com <strong>18 km de corrida<\/strong> (3 voltas de 6 km com 118 m D+) ao longo do passeio mar\u00edtimo at\u00e9 \u00e0 consagra\u00e7\u00e3o no p\u00f3rtico da meta.<\/p>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 0;\">O secretariado e levantamento de dorsais funcionam no Hotel Sines Sea View nos dias 25 e 26 de setembro, com check-in obrigat\u00f3rio de bicicletas no s\u00e1bado \u00e0 tarde. A cronometragem oficial \u00e9 garantida pela Lap2Go.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<p><!-- CARD 2: FICHA T\u00c9CNICA \/ SNAPSHOT --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.06); border: 1px solid rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.25); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u26a1 Ficha <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">T\u00e9cnica \/ Snapshot<\/span><\/h2>\n<ul class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-grid\" style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(240px, 1fr)); gap: 16px; width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box; list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 0;\">\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Data &#038; Hor\u00e1rio<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">27 de Setembro de 2026 \u00e0s 08:00<\/span><\/li>\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Local, Concelho &#038; Distrito<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">Passeio Vasco da Gama, Sines, Set\u00fabal<\/span><\/li>\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Dist\u00e2ncias<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">100 km (2 km Nata\u00e7\u00e3o, 80 km Ciclismo e 18 km Corrida)<\/span><\/li>\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Entidade Organizadora<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">HMS Sports e Munic\u00edpio de Sines<\/span><\/li>\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Tempo Limite (Cut-off)<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">6h30 no total (encerramento do controlo de meta \u00e0s 14:30)<\/span><\/li>\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.08); border: 1px solid rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.3); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #C4B5FD; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Regulamento Oficial<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\"><a href=\"https:\/\/sinestriathlon.pt\/site\/?local=regulations\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" style=\"color: #38BDF8; text-decoration: none; display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 6px;\"><br \/>\n                    \ud83d\udcc4 Consultar Regulamento Oficial &rarr;<br \/><\/a><\/span><\/li>\n<div style=\"grid-column: 1 \/ -1; margin-top: 8px;\"><strong style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px; display: block; margin-bottom: 10px;\">\ud83c\udfc3 Programa de Provas &#038; Sub-eventos<\/strong><\/p>\n<div style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(260px, 1fr)); gap: 12px;\">\n<div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; gap: 12px; flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n<div><span style=\"color: #C4B5FD; font-size: 11px; text-transform: uppercase; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.5px; display: block;\">Triatlo M\u00e9dia Dist\u00e2ncia<\/span><strong style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px;\">Sines Triathlon 100 km<\/strong><span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 13px; display: block; margin-top: 2px;\">\ud83d\udcc5 27 Set \u2022 \u23f0 Partida: 08:00<\/span><\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/ul>\n<\/div>\n<p><!-- CARD 3: PERGUNTAS FREQUENTES (FAQS) --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u2753 Perguntas <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">Frequentes (FAQ)<\/span><\/h2>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quando e onde se realiza o Sines Triathlon 2026?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">A prova realiza-se no domingo, <strong>27 de Setembro de 2026<\/strong>, com centro operacional e transi\u00e7\u00f5es no <strong>Passeio Vasco da Gama, Sines<\/strong>, e nata\u00e7\u00e3o na Praia da Ba\u00eda de Sines.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quais s\u00e3o as dist\u00e2ncias de cada segmento?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">O percurso totaliza 100 km, distribu\u00eddos por <strong>2 km de nata\u00e7\u00e3o<\/strong>, <strong>80 km de ciclismo<\/strong> (3 voltas) e <strong>18 km de corrida<\/strong> pedestre (3 voltas de 6 km).<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">A que horas \u00e9 dada a partida da competi\u00e7\u00e3o?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">A partida \u00e9 dada \u00e0s <strong>08:00<\/strong> na Praia da Ba\u00eda de Sines em sistema de <em>rolling start<\/em> ap\u00f3s o aquecimento pr\u00e9vio dos atletas.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Onde e quando funciona o secretariado e o check-in de bicicletas?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">O secretariado funciona no <strong>Hotel Sines Sea View<\/strong> na sexta-feira (14:00 \u00e0s 18:00) e s\u00e1bado (10:00 \u00e0s 17:00). O check-in obrigat\u00f3rio de bicicletas ocorre no s\u00e1bado entre as 14:30 e as 18:00 no Parque de Transi\u00e7\u00e3o.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">As inscri\u00e7\u00f5es ainda est\u00e3o dispon\u00edveis?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">As inscri\u00e7\u00f5es para a 3\u00aa edi\u00e7\u00e3o do Sines Triathlon encontram-se <strong>oficialmente esgotadas<\/strong> na plataforma oficial da organiza\u00e7\u00e3o.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<\/div>\n<p><script type=\"application\/ld+json\" data-no-optimize=\"1\">{\"@context\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\", \"@type\": \"SportsEvent\", \"name\": \"Sines Triathlon 2026\", \"startDate\": \"2026-09-27\", \"eventAttendanceMode\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/OfflineEventAttendanceMode\", \"eventStatus\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/EventScheduled\", \"location\": {\"@type\": \"Place\", \"name\": \"Sines, Set\u00fabal\", \"address\": {\"@type\": \"PostalAddress\", \"addressLocality\": \"Sines\", \"addressRegion\": \"Set\u00fabal\", \"addressCountry\": \"PT\"}}}<\/script><script type=\"application\/ld+json\" data-no-optimize=\"1\">{\"@context\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\", \"@type\": \"FAQPage\", \"mainEntity\": [{\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Quando e onde se realiza o Sines Triathlon 2026?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"A prova realiza-se no domingo,27 de Setembro de 2026, com centro operacional e transi\u00e7\u00f5es noPasseio Vasco da Gama, Sines, e nata\u00e7\u00e3o na Praia da Ba\u00eda de Sines.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Quais s\u00e3o as dist\u00e2ncias de cada segmento?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"O percurso totaliza 100 km, distribu\u00eddos por2 km de nata\u00e7\u00e3o,80 km de ciclismo(3 voltas) e18 km de corridapedestre (3 voltas de 6 km).\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"A que horas \u00e9 dada a partida da competi\u00e7\u00e3o?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"A partida \u00e9 dada \u00e0s08:00na Praia da Ba\u00eda de Sines em sistema derolling startap\u00f3s o aquecimento pr\u00e9vio dos atletas.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Onde e quando funciona o secretariado e o check-in de bicicletas?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"O secretariado funciona noHotel Sines Sea Viewna sexta-feira (14:00 \u00e0s 18:00) e s\u00e1bado (10:00 \u00e0s 17:00). O check-in obrigat\u00f3rio de bicicletas ocorre no s\u00e1bado entre as 14:30 e as 18:00 no Parque de Transi\u00e7\u00e3o.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"As inscri\u00e7\u00f5es ainda est\u00e3o dispon\u00edveis?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"As inscri\u00e7\u00f5es para a 3\u00aa edi\u00e7\u00e3o do Sines Triathlon encontram-seoficialmente esgotadasna plataforma oficial da organiza\u00e7\u00e3o.\"}}]}<\/script><\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":1,"featured_media":66797,"menu_order":0,"comment_status":"open","ping_status":"closed","template":"","meta":{"_acf_changed":false},"tags":[],"event_type":[27,47],"event_type_2":[728,820,48],"event_type_3":[],"event_type_4":[],"event_type_5":[],"class_list":["post-66677","ajde_events","type-ajde_events","status-publish","has-post-thumbnail","hentry","event_location-sines-setubal","event_type-corrida","event_type-sao-silvestre","event_type_2-algarve-e-sul","event_type_2-portugal","event_type_2-setubal"],"acf":[],"featured_image_src":"https:\/\/www.portugalr